  "tips": "**was dan were: bentuk lampau dari am / is / are**\n\n| Sekarang | Kemarin (lampau) |\n|---|---|\n| I **am** / he, she, it **is** | I / he / she / it **was** |\n| you / we / they **are** | you / we / they **were** |\n\n- *I **was** at home yesterday.* = Saya di rumah kemarin.\n- *They **were** busy yesterday.* = Mereka sibuk kemarin.\n\nBahasa Indonesia tidak mengubah kata apa pun untuk masa lalu, cukup menambah *kemarin*. Bahasa Inggris wajib mengubah *am / is / are*.\n*I am tired yesterday* ✗ → *I was tired yesterday* ✓\n\nKata baru: **yesterday** = kemarin, **at home** = di rumah, **sick** = sakit.",
